WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.340
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.970
Today, I'm going to explain a sci-fi thriller
film called “Level 16.”

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.349
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:08.349 --> 00:00:09.695
Watch out and take care!

00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:15.779
The movie starts in an all-girls hostel.

00:00:15.779 --> 00:00:18.039
Vivien and Sophia are best friends.

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:22.460
They talk about being adopted one day, suggesting
that the girls are all orphans.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.810
The hostel seems to have very strict rules.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:29.390
At night, when the blue lights turn on, all
of them go to sleep in their respective beds

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.980
without any question.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:35.660
In the morning, when the alarm goes off, they
all line up in front of the basin...with their

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.840
respective jar of face cream and towel to
“clean” themselves.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.579
They have to wash their face in front of a
camera.

00:00:41.579 --> 00:00:44.829
Even a little bit of sloppiness can put the
girls in big trouble.

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:49.710
That day, when it’s Vivien’s turn to wash
her face, Sophia drops her face cream.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:53.309
Sophia has bad eyesight so she has trouble
finding the cream.

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:56.719
Vivien runs to help her, so is a little late
for her turn.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:57.910
The alarms go off.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:01.789
Two guards drag Vivien away as she begs them
that she is clean.

00:01:01.789 --> 00:01:05.070
Sophia and the other girls silently face the
wall.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:09.120
The building they live in is an isolated,
artificially lit, and windowless boarding school.

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.520
The girls living there have never seen daylight.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.910
They have been in the establishment since
they were babies, starting from level zero.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.540
As they grow older, they move up to higher
floors and higher levels.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.850
The highest level is level sixteen.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:26.660
When the girls are in level sixteen, they
are eligible to be adopted.

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:29.810
Throughout their lives, they have been taught
to be 'clean' and proper.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:32.920
They are schooled in health, home skills,
and etiquette.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:36.880
They are taught that curiosity and anger are
vices that make them less of a girl.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:39.920
However, they are never taught to read and
write.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.700
Cut to a few years later.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.720
Vivien and Sophia reunite at level sixteen.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:48.960
But Vivien hates Sophia for being the reason
she was punished back in level ten.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.940
Vivien has now become a “top girl” who
follows the rules of the academy without any questions.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.440
The girls are happy to be at the last level.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:00.520
On their first day in level sixteen, they
pick a bed for themselves; then take the vitamins

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:01.520
one by one.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.320
Then, they go to eat and move on with their
routined life.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:09.599
That day, Sophia pulls Vivien aside in the
bathroom to tell her something, but Vivien

00:02:09.599 --> 00:02:11.310
dismisses her.

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.530
Miss Brixil is their supervisor.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:16.719
That day, during their assembly, she comes
in with good news.

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.520
Brixil has brought a pretty dress for the
girls.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.180
They are beyond delighted.

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.989
The dresses have their name embroidered on
them.

00:02:23.989 --> 00:02:27.760
The following day, the girls are doing their
chores when Sophia trades her chore with a

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:29.670
girl…to be with Vivien.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:34.170
She then tells her to just pretend to take
the vitamins and not actually take them.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:38.079
Before she can tell her the reason, a girl
comes looking for Vivien and takes her away.

00:02:38.079 --> 00:02:42.846
Vivien doesn’t trust Sophia, she is sceptical
of the idea but she doesn’t take the vitamins that day.

00:02:43.719 --> 00:02:47.849
Later that night, all girls fall asleep except
for Vivien and Sophia.

00:02:47.849 --> 00:02:51.950
Sophia then reveals that the vitamins are
actually sleeping pills and that the establishment

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:54.459
has been drugging the girls since level one.

00:02:54.459 --> 00:02:57.400
As they talk, they hear footsteps outside
the door.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.250
So, they quickly pretend to be asleep.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.420
Miss Brixil and two guards enter the room.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:06.049
Brixil chooses two of the girls, Vivien and
Olivia.

00:03:06.049 --> 00:03:09.000
The guards pick both of them up and take them
to a room.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.069
Then, Miss Brixil comes in with an old couple.

00:03:12.069 --> 00:03:15.569
She tells them about the girls as if they
are goods she is trying to sell.

00:03:15.569 --> 00:03:17.319
The couple chooses Olivia.

00:03:17.319 --> 00:03:18.720
They want to buy her.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.180
Vivien is shocked to know that they are not
being adopted, but bought by rich families.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.719
Then, she is brought back by the guards to
the room again.

00:03:26.719 --> 00:03:29.980
Vivien finally believes everything that Sophia
has said.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:34.670
Sophia then reveals that she has not taken
those pills since level thirteen; every night,

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.859
she stays awake as the girls sleep.

00:03:36.859 --> 00:03:40.469
When they got to level sixteen, the guards
started taking girls out every night to show

00:03:40.469 --> 00:03:42.189
them to their clients.

00:03:42.189 --> 00:03:46.909
When asked what she does at night, Sophia
reveals that she listens to the girls outside.

00:03:46.909 --> 00:03:51.379
When these girls go to sleep, the other levels
of girls wake up and do the same routine.

00:03:51.379 --> 00:03:55.359
She also tells her about the black hour, where
the hallways go silent and every level of

00:03:55.359 --> 00:03:56.940
girls is asleep.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:02.540
In that hour, a security guard comes into
the room and touches the sleeping girls inappropriately.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:05.569
As they talk, Brixil comes into the room again.

00:04:05.569 --> 00:04:08.389
This time she takes Sophia and one other girl.

00:04:08.389 --> 00:04:11.709
After they are gone, Vivien sees the doors
are unlocked.

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:15.190
She is in front of the surveillance camera,
but no alarms ring.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.989
She then tries to open the door outside, but
can’t, so she goes back to the room again.

00:04:19.989 --> 00:04:22.950
Soon, Sophia is brought back too.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:26.670
The following day, the girls are taken to
Dr. Miro’s clinic.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.510
He does his monthly check-up on the girls
and injects them with a chemical... posing

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:31.980
it as a vaccine.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.940
The doctor seems to be friendly.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:38.560
He tells Vivien of an actress of the same
name, Vivien Leigh, and compliments her smile.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.120
Later, the girls have their movie night.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.460
They watch the same movie that they have been
shown for years.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:49.530
That night, after the girls fall asleep, Vivien
and Sophia talk about escaping the building.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:52.440
They know that they need the keycard to open
the doors.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:56.140
Sophia suggests that they steal it from the
guard that comes in during the black hour;

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.150
but Vivien is against the idea.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.660
Instead, she thinks that Dr. Miro can help
them.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:05.530
The following day she goes to Dr. Miro’s
clinic without him calling her.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:09.580
She makes up an excuse about wanting to know
what the actress Vivien Leigh looks like.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.170
The doctor lovingly tells her that he will
look into it.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:15.950
Later that day, the girls are playing some
board games, when one of them gets a seizure

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.620
and starts to vomit.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:21.920
Sophia helps her clean up, while one of the
girls, Ava, suggests they should call the guards.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.310
She assumes that it is because of the vaccine
they were injected with.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:31.000
That day, as the girls are in their grooming
class, the video of Vivien Leigh plays.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.120
Vivien knows that Dr. Miro put on the show.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:37.580
At the next Doctor’s appointment, Vivien
thanks Dr Miro.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:41.570
But as they talk, the doctor gets suspicious
that she has not been taking her vitamins lately.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.580
So he injects her with a drug that will make
her fall asleep.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.800
The whole day, Vivien is hazy.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.710
She slurs on her words while talking to Sophia
and her hair is messy too.

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:56.090
Ava assumes this is because Vivien is lazy
and “unclean”, so she reports it to Ms Brixil.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:01.130
She gathers the girls and takes Vivien with
her to punish her for being unclean.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:05.020
She then puts her in a tiny cell and tells
her to reflect on her actions.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.970
Brixil then goes back to her room in the building.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.810
She pours two glasses of alcohol and we get
to know that Dr. Miro and her are actually a couple.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:16.580
They have a conversation about their boss
who brings the clients.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.810
Suggesting that they, too, work for someone.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:22.230
Miro reveals that their boss wants them to
“restock” on girls.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.900
Brixil is against the idea, she wants to get
out of this business, but Miro suggests that

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.600
they don't have to bring infant girls; they
can get some teenagers and admit them to the establishment.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.450
However, Brixil doesn’t agree.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:35.710
Cut to that night.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:39.970
Vivien is still in the cell, while Sophia
makes a rope using the bedsheets.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:43.970
She plans to attack the security guard who
comes to harass the girls at night.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.900
Just then, he comes in.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.740
When he is about to touch one of the girls,
Sophia chokes him with the rope.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.260
She then rushes outside to free Vivien.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.810
But before she can, the guard attacks her.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:59.060
He is almost about to kill her when she saves
herself by hitting him with an iron, her nightgown

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.820
is splattered with blood.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.380
She then takes his keycard and rushes to Vivien.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:05.910
However, the alarm starts to ring.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.680
Hence, Sophia runs back to the room.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:12.060
Vivien cries and tells her to not leave her
this time.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:16.670
Sometime later, Brixil gets Vivien out and
makes her and the other girls stand in line.

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:18.260
Miro is there too.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:23.100
They tell the girls that Sophia has betrayed
the establishment and will be punished accordingly.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:26.100
Then they ask if the girls have the card that
Sophia took.

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.540
No one speaks.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:30.500
Turns out that Sophia had hidden the card
before she was caught.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.730
Dr. Miro is furious.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:36.810
He threatens the girls that he will take each
one of them for a punishment one by one...until

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.190
they find the card.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.970
He then asks the guards to take Rita for the
punishment.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:44.870
She begs that she hasn’t done anything wrong,
but the guards take her away.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:46.860
Vivien doesn’t know where they have taken
Sophia.

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:50.070
Brixil is now more strict with the vitamin
rule.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.900
She feeds the girls the as vitamins herself.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:57.000
That night, Vivien stabs herself with her
hair clip to try and stay awake.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.700
She looks for the card everywhere on Sophia’s
bed, then finds it in the headboard of her own bed

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:04.990
Sophia had left it there to help her friend
run away.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.440
Vivien tries to open the room door with it,
but it doesn’t work.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:13.290
Then she gets an idea; she takes her hairpin
and starts to remove the door altogether.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.100
She finally gets out of the room.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:18.910
Then, she goes to Dr. Miro’s cabin and finds
Brixil there.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:23.830
Brixil tries to inject Vivien with a sedative,
but she attacks her and injects her instead.

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:28.200
Vivien then asks her about Sophia’s whereabouts
but doesn’t get any answer.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:31.660
She then sneaks into the prison cells in the
basement of the building.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:34.139
Sophia is in one of the rooms there.

00:08:34.139 --> 00:08:37.069
Using Brixil’s card, she manages to free
her.

00:08:37.069 --> 00:08:38.779
But her hands are zip-tied.

00:08:38.779 --> 00:08:41.180
The girls then find a surgical room with scissors.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.560
They use it to cut the zip tie.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.769
But they also reveal the body of their friend,
Rita.

00:08:46.769 --> 00:08:48.939
She was taken that morning for punishment.

00:08:48.939 --> 00:08:52.660
The girls are horrified to see her face has
been skinned; they are now determined to run away.

00:08:53.769 --> 00:08:58.079
Sophia wants to warn other girls but Vivien
wants to run away, so they decide that Sophia

00:08:58.079 --> 00:09:02.540
will go to the halls and bring all the girls
to a room, while Vivien stays there.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:06.390
So, Sophia goes in and collects as many girls
as she can.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:10.889
Meanwhile, as Vivien waits for her, she hears
a guard coming towards her.

00:09:10.889 --> 00:09:13.069
She escapes and hides inside a room.

00:09:13.069 --> 00:09:15.000
There, she finds a TV.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.509
A video starts to play.

00:09:16.509 --> 00:09:19.050
It is an advertisement of some sort.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:24.260
Dr. Miro, in the video, explains a procedure
to regain your youth by planting a beautiful

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.459
donor’s face onto your own.

00:09:26.459 --> 00:09:30.470
Vivien realizes that they have been brought
up all these years, and raised in a sterile

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:34.810
environment without sunlight, so rich "sponsors"
can pay to get the skin of these young girls

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.980
transplanted onto them, to make them appear
more youthful.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:41.550
Rita’s face was skinned because she was
chosen by a client.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:45.079
Elsewhere, Sophia brings all the girls to
a room.

00:09:45.079 --> 00:09:48.940
She tries to explain to them what is happening
but the girls do not believe her.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.069
They even threaten to call the guards.

00:09:51.069 --> 00:09:53.820
But just then, Vivien comes in with Brixil.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.399
She is intoxicated because of the sedative.

00:09:56.399 --> 00:09:59.600
Vivien tells them about Rita’s skinned body
downstairs.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.649
She then shows them Brixil’s scars revealing
that she too was a client, and was wearing

00:10:03.649 --> 00:10:05.009
someone’s face.

00:10:05.009 --> 00:10:07.260
The girls now finally believe them.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:11.430
They take Brixil to the cell she had put Vivien
earlier in, and rush out of the building through

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:12.749
the escape door.

00:10:12.749 --> 00:10:15.430
However, the guards find them midway.

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:18.680
Most of the girls run; but Sophia is caught
by the guard.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.589
He injures her but the girls manage to push
him off the building, killing him.

00:10:22.589 --> 00:10:25.389
Then, all of them run away in different directions.

00:10:25.389 --> 00:10:29.761
The guards almost catch Sophia and Vivien,
but they lock themselves into an abandoned house.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:35.499
Dr Miro and the guards are outside; and he
lovingly tells Vivien to come outside.

00:10:35.499 --> 00:10:39.550
But Vivien cuts her face...proving that she
is of no use to Miro now.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:43.930
The guards get a call from their boss who
orders them to kill Miro since he has failed.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.190
That night, the girls stay in the room.

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:49.319
In the morning they are rescued by two police
officers.

00:10:49.319 --> 00:10:53.769
The movie ends as Vivien and Sophia come outside
the house and see the rainfall for the first

00:10:53.769 --> 00:10:55.629
time in their lives.

00:10:55.629 --> 00:10:59.259
Subscribe for more videos like this, turn
on notifications, and leave a like to help

00:10:59.259 --> 00:11:00.259
the channel out.

00:11:01.051 --> 00:11:01.947
Thank you for watching.

